# Resume, CV, exported profile data — read by /onboard, never committed.
# This is the one directory that holds documents the user did not write here.
# The README is tracked so a fresh clone gets the directory and knows what it's for.
intake/*
!intake/README.md

# Per-machine tool permissions. Everything else under .claude/ is committed
# deliberately so a fresh clone works with no setup.
.claude/settings.local.json

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
